  "description": "YITAMOTOR Running Boards fit for 15-25 Ford F150 SuperCrew Cab/ 17-25 Ford F250-F350 Super Duty Crew Cab. They are made of anti-corrosion aluminum with UV-resistant non-slip step pads and can provide a secure, slip-proof, and comfortable step for the whole family.\nFitment\n2015-2026 Ford F150 SuperCrew Cab Pickup 4-Door\n2017-2026 Ford F-250 F-350 Super Duty Crew Cab\nNote: Please ensure these side step bars fit your Truck before purchase\nFeatures\nThis running board side step fits for 2015-2026 Ford F150 SuperCrew Cab Pickup 4-Door & 2017-2026 Ford F250, F350 Super Duty Crew Cab. (Please check the cab size picture if you are unsure of your exact model.)\nEasy bolt-on installation with no drilling required. All factory holes are perfectly aligned with the mounts; bolts to factory mount in less than an hour.\nRunning boards structure provides strength and durability. The 6-inch non-slip injection step pad allows for easy movement such as stepping in, stepping out, and even jumping (450 lb. capacity).\nMade from top grade anti-corrosion aluminum and pre-treated with rust-resistant black powder coatings. One piece design ensures great performance and look for years to come.\nPackage includes 2 running boards, 6 brackets, relevant hardware, and detailed installation instructions.\nProfessional installation recommended",
